  "statement": "theorem theorem_2_13_fixed (V : Domain E) (η : ℝ) (hη : 0 < η) (loss : ℕ → E → ℝ) (x₁ : E) (hx₁ : x₁ ∈ V.carrier) (T : ℕ) (hloss : ∀ t < T, FeasibleRegularLoss V (loss t)) (u : E) (hu : u ∈ V.carrier) : regret V η loss x₁ u T ≤ ‖x₁ - u‖ ^ 2 / (2 * η) + η / 2 * (∑ t ∈ range T, ‖gradient (loss t) (iterate V η loss x₁ t)‖ ^ 2) - ‖iterate V η loss x₁ T - u‖ ^ 2 / (2 * η)",
